                        <h2 class="title">提升核心素养  指明备考方向  ——记我校张叠老师主持的绍兴市高中历史名师工作室首次教研活动</h2>
                        <!-- 副标题 -->
                        <h3 class="subTitle"><span>提升核心素养  指明备考方向  ——记我校张叠老师主持的绍兴市高中历史名师工作室首次教研活动</span></h3>
                        <script>
                        $(".Subheading span:empty").parent().hide()
                        </script>
                        <div class="property"> <span>文章来源：</span> <span>作者：</span> <span>发布时间：2021年04月20日</span> <span>点击数：
    <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Common/GetHits.aspx?id=13216"></script>
    次</span>  <span><span id="content_AdminEdit"></span>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(document).ready(function()
{
    $.pe.ajax('admineditcheck',{params:{itemId:13216},success:function(s) {
        if ($(s).find('status').text() == 'OK') {
            var managedir = "/Common/GetContentEdit.aspx?itemId=13216";
           $("#content_AdminEdit").html("【<a href='" + managedir + "' target='_blank'>进入后台编辑</a>】")
        }
    }});
});
</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style=";text-align:center">
</p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">为提高</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">运用</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">统编新教材</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">教学能力，促进教师专业素养提升，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">优化</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">备战高考</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">历史科目</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">选考，</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">16</span><span style="font-family:宋体">—</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">17</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">绍兴市张叠高中历史名师工作室</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">在新昌县知新中学举行</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">工作室成立仪式</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">，并</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“高中历史新教材实践与浙江历史选考复习研讨”为主题</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">开展</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">送教活动。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">在美丽的天姥山下、沃洲湖畔，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">送教</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">活动围绕</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“核心素养”，聚焦“备考方略”，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">节奏</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">紧凑，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">内容</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">充实，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">带给人</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">丰</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">厚的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">收获！</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 黑体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 19px">研修启航：教书育人的维度</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">首先举行了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">名师工作室</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">成立仪式。浙派名师、绍兴市高中历史优质课一等奖获得者、绍兴一中历史教研组长、名师工作室主持人张叠老师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">做了工作室成立讲话</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">详细介绍了工作室的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">工作安排与建设计划</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">，不仅从</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">制度建设、平台</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">打造上明确了具体目标，而且在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">研训展示、帮扶结对、课题研究等方面</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">对工作室成员提出了具体要求</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">随后，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">首度相聚的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">工作室成员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">们一一做了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">自我介绍，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">并</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">分享了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">各自的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">职业成长计划</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">工作室共有</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">5</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">名成员，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">分别</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">来自越城区、柯桥区、上虞区和新昌县的</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">所高中，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">不少成员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">毕业于浙江大学、北京师范大学、华东师范大学、香港大学等知名高校，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">其中</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">有</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">7</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">人</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">拥有硕士学位</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">，不少成员已经取得了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">区</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">县</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">学科带头人</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">“一师一优课”部优课</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">等</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">教学科研</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">方面的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">业绩。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200937076918.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200937076918.jpg" /> </span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 黑体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 19px">课堂展示：核心素养的厚度</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">在教学展示环节，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">两位工作室成员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">分别</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">执教</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">《第一次世界大战与战后国际秩序》</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">，进行</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">同课异构，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">呈现了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">两节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">精彩的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">研讨课。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">来自新昌县知新中学的杨珂珂老师以</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“百年德国的第一次变身”为主线，从德国角度看世界大战，立意新颖，主线明晰。杨老师以德国疆域变迁图导入，创设情境，以“变身前的热身”、“变身时的坎坷”、“变身后的辛酸”三个环节建构课堂，诠释了世界大战爆发的时代背景、战争经过、战后影响。杨老师注重学生核心素养的培养，尤其是时空观念、史料实证的运用，充分利用“协约国、同盟国形势图”、“世界大战形势图”、“一战后欧洲领土变迁示意图”等典型地图</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">辅以时间轴，并结合详实史料，巧设问题，环环相扣，充分诠释了重难点</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">教学，贯彻了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">生本课堂</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">理念</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">。杨老师语态亲和，循序善诱，师生互动热烈，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">令人</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">印象深刻。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200937255959.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200937255959.jpg" /></span></p><p style="line-height: 150%; text-indent: 2em;"><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">来自柯桥区越崎中学的刘启文老师以“理想照不进现实”为主线来设计课堂，以德皇威廉二世妄图称霸欧洲、吞噬地球的漫画来入题，通过“争取阳光下的地盘”、“叶落之前返回故乡”、“人类管理迈出一大步”三个理想来重构教材。整节课立意高远，结构严谨，尤其注重历史解释、史料实证核心素养的运用。刘老师以德国的理想与现实困境之间的巨大反差来渗透历史思维</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">，体现</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">思辨</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">教学</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">，运用大量史料，辅以导学案，巧设问题，从多个维度启发学生探究一战爆发的原因和战后影响，深入浅出，</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">使</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">课堂富有哲</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">理</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">深度。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200939217349.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200939217349.jpg" /> </span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 黑体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 19px">交流研讨：思维碰撞的深度</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">两节课后，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">工作室成员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">进行了热烈研讨。来自越州中学的陈波老师从课时中心把握、史料选择运用、课堂生成师生互动、板书设计呈现</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">等</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">四个角度对两堂课分别作了评价，同时提出了自己对本课内容详略取舍的一些看法。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200940255757.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200940255757.jpg" /> </span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">来自春晖中学的余国云老师从时空观念、问题意识、师生互动、历史专业阅读与教学设计、初高中知识衔接</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">等</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">五个方面点评了两节课的精彩之处，并以帝国主义、军国主义、民族主义三个名词的解释为例分析了教材。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200940428160.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200940428160.jpg" /> </span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">来自新昌中学的孙舒曼老师则以</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“一战形势图”细节为补充，指出关于一战中德国进攻法国与两线作战、战线分布等问题可以进一步探究。</span></span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200940593207.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200940593207.jpg" /> </span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 黑体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 19px">专家引领：备考方略的高度</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">张叠老师为知新中学全体历史老师和高三选考历史</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">学生带来</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">精彩讲座</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">——</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">《量</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“题”裁衣   对症下药：选考试题的解读和历史教材的整合》</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">整个报告厅座无虚席</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">，与会师生反响热烈，收获满满。</span></p><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200941165578.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200941165578.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200941160624.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200941160624.jpg" /></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">首先，张老师精心梳理研究近七年的浙江选考历史试卷，全面分析了材料题的高频考点、选考要求、题型特点</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">、</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">设问规律、答案构思</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">等特点</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">。接下来，张老师用大量详实材料，结合时事热点素材，将高考真题、模拟题与教材结合，</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">分享</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">了整合历史教材进行备考的宝贵</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">经验和方法</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">。张老师以罗马—意大利史、欧洲联合史专题为例</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">，</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">重点讲解指出</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">：</span><span style="text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;">一要贯通古今、关联中西、融合模块，二要联通时空、点通史实、拔通思维，三要理清逻辑、深度解读、精准对接，四要左图右史、关注热点、回归教材。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">绍兴市张叠高中历史名师工作室</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">首次教研活动取得圆满成功，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">精彩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">的教研之旅就此启程。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">工作室的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">成员们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">将以</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">名师工作室为平台</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">打牢基础，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">切磋</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">研讨，锤炼能力，教学相长，共同进步，为成为有梦想、有情怀、懂生活、有温度的优秀历史老师而努力！</span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/4/202104200941539052.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202104200941539052.jpg" /> </span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px">      </span></p><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: Calibri;line-height: 150%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p>
</p>
    
